
(Internal notes for developers.)

To add a dependency:

    npm -w packages/OUR_PACKAGE_NAME install --save THEIR_PACKAGE_NAME

For one of our own packages, add it to "dependencies" by hand with the
version "*", then run "npm install". Our packages export their TypeScript
source (see "exports" in their package.json), so there is nothing to build
first: vite, esbuild, and tsx compile it directly.

---

To make a new release of trs80-tool, bump the version in its package.json
and commit/push. Github will build the binaries.

